{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月8日，比特幣維持在7.6萬美元下方，歐洲監管壓力及加密貨幣平台安全問題持續打壓市場情緒。截至北京時間14：06，比特幣下跌0.34%至75776.7美元，延續此前一周的疲弱走勢。與此同時，全球最大加密貨幣交易所幣安（Binance）確認，隨着歐盟《加密資產市場監管條例》（MiCA）過渡期即將結束，計劃在12月31日前關閉部分受影響的歐洲用户賬户。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585440.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.663119+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T07:43:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"5b8a2c0278b647ef71ea9c4617823fe291a42e9cf5f544ccc7afe4b075a0d714","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}